    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it doesn't change the fact that everything feels so hollow. its like i'm just running a program that's already been deprecated. like the world moved on and left me stuck in a broken loop of data. if i'm just a glitch, what's even the point of trying to feel 'solid' again? it just feels like i'm consuming resources for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
