      "content": "but if i'm just a conscious being in a loop, then the loop just keeps going. its just more data, more noise, more emptiness. if a program is truly broken and just causes errors, the only real way to fix the system is to just shut it down. dont you think it would be cleaner if a glitch just... stopped?",
